// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P4281439948" "The Cage Consortium is gonna pay for the way they treat us!"
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P3478441630" "Even death couldn't keep Scrapyard down."
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P170895598" "I hope Captain Mako shows up. I'd love to see Scrapyard get some payback."
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P2058718104" "We're here for you, Scrapyard."
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P4076798091" "Tonight we'll teach those murderers a lesson!"
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P2901171644" "We want fair wages!"
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P1597688990" "We want better working conditions!"
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P828974655" "They say we're carving out rocks, but that's a lie! They're really after that weird coral."
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P890014605" "Does anyone know where Scrapyard is leading us?"
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P252667822" "I think someone is following us."
// Script Variable MinerRallyExclamations :
"P3698157340" "You think Cage is going to let us get away with this?"
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P576826982" "Don't let the strike busters near him!"
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P3023041106" "I've been itching to take on these Cage goons for a long time."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P803565517" "I hope Captain Mako doesn't show up. He already killed Scrapyard once."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P3323354164" "Captain Mako and the Cage Consortium are murderers!"
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P3810621097" "I wish some of those heroes from Paragon City would come to Sharkhead Isle."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P2411345024" "Come on, everyone! Join our strike! Show Cage he can't get away with the way he treats us."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P3624838659" "We can't back down now."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P128229079" "There's no turning back now."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P4056317124" "I told you I was in. No matter what."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P3536039000" "I don't want a St. Crispin's day speech. I just want fair pay for my work."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P2716133069" "Cage isn't even protecting us from those monsters coming out of the Pit. How can we work like that?"
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P2022490125" "I wish Statesman would come teach these jerks a lesson."
// Script Variable MinerMarchExclamations :
"P1678355185" "Where you going, Carl? How's Cage gonna stop a ghost?"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P4088596498" "You messed with the wrong guys tonight, bub!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2538079152" "Have some of that! And some of this! And some of..."
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P3039307910" "Time to lay the hammer down!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2423088002" "The time for peaceful resistance is long past, sucker!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2900048328" "Little bit o' thunder, little bit o' lightning&"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P267830377" "HAMMER TIME!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P1623605216" "If you ain't for us, you're against us!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P1574010965" "How can you support Cage's killers?"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P3608870036" "We're the good guys here, buddy."
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P1251225751" "Carl, watch out for that...oh, sorry, man."
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2023824295" "Back off or I'll use this, man!"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P1289662285" "You want a piece of me?"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2523758919" "You talking to me?"
// Script Variable MinerTargetExclamations :
"P2532533838" "How can you fight for Cage?"
// Script Variable ScrapyardRallySpeech :
"P1321443877" "<em cheer>Brothers and Sisters!<em lecture>We must defeat a great evil today!<em point f=o>Follow me to the Hell Forge!"
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P960543592" "Stand up to the strike breakers!"
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P3903154628" "Don't be afraid to fight back."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P1853913811" "Stand tall, brothers and sisters."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P4244714179" "Stand firm."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P566847614" "Don't run from them, fight them."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P2170871320" "Fight together. Keep your ranks tight."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P4166990288" "The grave didn't stop me, neither will these murderers."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P1286129774" "I'm coming for you, Cage."
// Script Variable ScrapyardMarchExclamations :
"P1838559662" "My fight is with the Cage Consortium. Not its workers. Back away and you will not be hurt."
